<title>THAILAND: GCN Finance debuts at 23.50 baht.</title>
<headline>GCN Finance debuts at 23.50 baht.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>GCN Finance Plc debuted at 23.50 baht on Wednesday in an overall bearish Thai stock exchange against its initial public offer price of 28 baht.</p>
<p>At 0304 GMT, GCN eased further to 23 baht. The finance firm topped the early most-active list with some 844,800 of its shares changing hands.  </p>
<p>&quot;GCN is not expected to perform well because it trades under the battered finance sector, where third-quarter earnings should be weak,&quot; said Padermpob Songkroh of Nava Finance and Securities.</p>
</text>
